go-x11proto (0.0.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging.
  * Build three binary packages: golang-github-x11libre-go-x11proto-dev
    (the Go library sources), xnamespace (the X-NAMESPACE client tool) and
    tetris64 (the demo game). The simple/editor demos are left out for now.

